*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

# This folder is Windows/OneDrive-synced (see desktop.ini), so text dropped here
# arrives with CRLF. `validate.yml`'s whitespace step reads a CR as trailing
# whitespace and fails the whole job, which is how validation-report.json and
# sha256sums.txt held CI red. Normalise on commit so the next drop cannot
# reintroduce it. The zips and PDFs above stay binary and are untouched.
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
